sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as ASP.NET Core API
    participant AF as Antiforgery
    participant AUTH as AuthService
    participant DB as MySQL

    U->>FE: Open login page
    FE->>API: GET /api/auth/csrf
    API->>AF: Generate antiforgery token
    AF-->>API: Request token + antiforgery cookie
    API-->>FE: 204 No Content + XSRF-TOKEN cookie

    U->>FE: Submit username/password
    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/login + X-CSRF-TOKEN
    API->>AF: Validate CSRF token
    AF-->>API: Valid
    API->>AUTH: AuthenticateAsync(request)
    AUTH->>DB: Load user by username
    DB-->>AUTH: User record
    AUTH->>AUTH: Verify BCrypt password
    AUTH->>AUTH: Resolve role + auth_version
    AUTH-->>API: Authenticated user
    API-->>FE: Set cookie session + return session payload

    FE->>API: GET /api/auth/session
    API->>DB: Revalidate current user
    DB-->>API: User + current role/auth_version
    API-->>FE: SessionResponseDto

    Note over FE,API: All protected API calls now use cookie session

    FE->>API: POST /api/users or /api/evaluations
    API->>AF: Validate CSRF token
    API->>API: Validate cookie principal
    API->>DB: Re-check auth_version and role
    DB-->>API: Current user state
    API-->>FE: Authorized response

    Note over API,DB: If role/password changed, auth_version mismatch rejects stale session

    U->>FE: Logout
    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/logout + X-CSRF-TOKEN
    API->>AF: Validate CSRF token
    API-->>FE: Clear session cookie + refresh antiforgery state
